#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Minimal floquet photo-assisted current from Viljas and Cuevas, 2007.

    I = (e/h) int_0^{hw} de  sum_{k,l} Tr[Gr Gam_R^(k) Ga Gam_L^(l)] (f_L^(l) - f_R^(k))

    [Gam_W^(l)]_{m,n} = J_{m+l}(a_W) J_{n+l}(a_W) Gam_W(e - udc_W - l hw)
    [Sig_W]_{m,n}     = sum_l J_{m+l}(a_W) J_{n+l}(a_W) Sig_W(e - udc_W - l hw)

Lead quantities sig_L/sig_R/gam_L/gam_R are supplied should be given as
callables  e -> (norb, norb) array.  Energies in eV, current in amperes.

"""

